              <SHORT-NAME>SentDMAConfigSet</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">
                    &lt;html&gt;
                      This container is the base of an Configuration Set SENT DMA which contains the configured Sent channels. This way, different configuration sets can be defined for post-build process.</L-2>
